import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 105 | Realm Refinement · Sense Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 105 | Realm Refinement · Sense Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","no":105,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Sense Origin Realm","Cultivation Risks","Breakthrough Costs","Alaya Supervision"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","97-Setting Contradiction Checklist"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0105_模块1-感元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md","filePath":"en/0105_模块1-感元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"}'),r={name:"en/0105_模块1-感元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"};function o(s,e,l,u,h,c){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-105-sense-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 105 | Sense Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-105-sense-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 105 | Sense Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 19, 04, 97</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-more-universal-power-becomes-the-more-supervision-is-required" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The more universal power becomes, the more supervision is required <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-more-universal-power-becomes-the-more-supervision-is-required" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The more universal power becomes, the more supervision is required&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The hyper-multiverse fully open baseline of Heng Yuan Zhou (The Original Cosmos of Ten Thousand Spirits and the Balanced Anchor) makes Sense Origin Realm methods freely available to all Myriad Races — but this by no means implies &quot;laissez-faire.&quot; On the contrary: when cultivation shifts from a privilege of the few to a basic right of all Myriad Races, supervision shifts from &quot;controlling the strong&quot; to &quot;protecting everyone.&quot; The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision mechanism is precisely the infrastructure built for this goal.</p><p>The Sense Origin Realm seems low-risk, yet it is the source of all cultivation risks: every hidden danger left here amplifies along the nine-realm path. This document systematically reviews the risks, breakthrough costs, and supervision mechanisms of the Sense Origin Realm.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the value origin of the supervision mechanism: the anti-predation axiom — the first mission of supervision is to make predation nowhere to hide; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — supervision treats all Myriad Races equally; the collective ascension axiom — protecting cultivators is protecting civilizational assets, eliminating talent underuse; the causal self-discipline axiom — no cultivation behavior may disturb the causality of others or the environment; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of the Alaya supervision mechanism is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse. The universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose higher levels of infinity; infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-four-core-risks-of-the-sense-origin-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Four Core Risks of the Sense Origin Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-core-risks-of-the-sense-origin-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Core Risks of the Sense Origin Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Qi deviation / demonic backlash: perceptual confusion — cultivators eager for results force open perceptual channels, causing energy backflow and chaotic consciousness. Sense Origin Realm qi deviation is not fatal, but may permanently damage perceptual precision</li><li>Energy pollution: absorbing energy with impurities or residual will traces contaminates the personal energy map, laying groundwork for future &quot;impure origin&quot;</li><li>Shortcut inner demon: the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon&#39;s typical form in the Sense Origin Realm is the temptation of &quot;devouring others&#39; energy is faster&quot; — remnants of the old system especially like spreading such heretical fast-track doctrines among junior cultivators</li><li>Predation risk: junior cultivators have weak energy and low vigilance, making them exactly the &quot;prey&quot; in the eyes of predatory remnants; spiritual enslavement and energy plunder often start from this realm</li></ol><h2 id="ii-breakthrough-costs-controllable-but-must-be-real" tabindex="-1">II. Breakthrough Costs: Controllable, But Must Be Real <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-breakthrough-costs-controllable-but-must-be-real" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Breakthrough Costs: Controllable, But Must Be Real&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Breaking through from Sense Origin Realm to Condensed Origin Realm requires real costs:</p><ul><li>Time cost: normal path takes weeks to months (Document 14); rushing to compress time accepts higher risk</li><li>Resource cost: basic resources are allocated by the contracted responsibility system (Document 90), more work more gain, no work no gain — eliminating both &quot;resource freeloading&quot; and &quot;resource monopoly&quot;</li><li>Foundation cost: forcing a breakthrough before energy identification is complete leaves hidden perceptual wounds; the breakthrough cost is &quot;pressing on wounded&quot; vs. &quot;resetting to start&quot;</li><li>Failure cost: breakthrough failure may trigger energy backlash, but the anchor network&#39;s monitoring and repair mechanisms ensure failure is reversible and repeatable</li></ul><p>The core principle: breakthrough costs must be real (otherwise growth has no weight), but the predatory-style &quot;one false step, eternal regret&quot; irreversible destruction is never allowed.</p><h2 id="iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision" tabindex="-1">III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Sense Origin Realm supervision forms a closed loop via &quot;Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision&quot;:</p><p>Layer 1 · Anchor automatic monitoring: the anchor network continuously monitors energy levels, perceptual stability, energy purity, and other metrics (Document 14&#39;s certification mechanism); anomalies trigger instant warnings Layer 2 · Ethical review: advanced breakthroughs require review by the Ethical Review Committee (Document 17), confirming anti-predation stance and symbiotic philosophy Layer 3 · Anti-Predation Committee: the Anti-Predation Committee under the Myriad Races Republican Council (Document 04) is specifically responsible for supervising and investigating predation; spread of &quot;fast-track heresies&quot; in the Sense Origin Realm is a key target Layer 4 · Anchor Court and judicial backstop: major crimes involving spiritual enslavement and energy plunder are tried by the Anchor Court according to law Layer 5 · Civilizational supervision: publicity and objection periods (Document 14) allow every being to object to breakthrough certification; supervisory power belongs to the Myriad Races</p><h2 id="iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-sense-origin-realm" tabindex="-1">IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Sense Origin Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-sense-origin-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Sense Origin Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The six cultivation ethics principles of Document 19 concretized in the Sense Origin Realm:</p><ul><li>Dignity of life: Sense Origin Realm cultivation never treats others as &quot;material&quot; or &quot;tools&quot;</li><li>Anti-predation: the first mouthful of energy comes from circulation, not devouring</li><li>Informed consent: dual cultivation, energy sharing, and collective cultivation are always premised on voluntariness</li><li>Minimum harm: cultivation occurs in regulated venues; energy pollution is cleared on detection</li><li>Honesty without deception: realm certification and contribution reporting prohibit fabrication</li><li>Accountability: even in the Sense Origin Realm, basic community service obligations apply — however small the power, responsibility exists</li></ul><h2 id="v-comparison-unregulated-jungle-vs-full-stack-guardianship" tabindex="-1">V. Comparison: Unregulated Jungle vs. Full-Stack Guardianship <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-comparison-unregulated-jungle-vs-full-stack-guardianship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Comparison: Unregulated Jungle vs. Full-Stack Guardianship&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory Sense Origin Realm: no supervision, only a hunting ground; no responsibility, only strength and weakness. Geniuses are hunted, kindness is devoured</li><li>Symbiotic Sense Origin Realm: full-stack guardianship, risks can be warned, costs can be repaired, predation can be pursued</li></ul><p>This supervision is not a restraint on freedom, but the fulfillment of &quot;everyone has a path&quot;: only when the weakest Sense Origin Realm cultivator can cultivate in peace is the hyper-multiverse fully open truly open.</p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Anti-energy waste: the supervision mechanism ensures no talent is wasted by risk, no effort is intercepted by predation</li><li>Anti-predation: striking &quot;fast-track heresies&quot; at the source, nailing the shortcut inner demon in the first realm</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system (Tang-Luo&#39;s Peerless Academy) had no supervision network; under patronage, undercurrents flowed; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s openness comes with full-stack guardianship</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: the supervision mechanism treats 99% of Myriad Races equally; exotic life and planetary life are equally protected by anchor monitoring, ensuring no talent is wasted</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: every link of openness is paired with guardianship; openness and safety are never a single-choice question</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The supervisory philosophy of the Sense Origin Realm can be condensed to one sentence: control risks, keep costs real, keep the road open. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision mechanism give Myriad Race cultivators a third choice beyond &quot;absolute safety&quot; and &quot;false safety&quot; for the first time — steady growth amid real costs and full-stack guardianship. This is precisely where the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization outranks all predatory systems: it does not rule by fear, nor promise by deception, but lets people grow stronger with peace of mind through institutions.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting Contradiction Checklist</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=i(r,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
